==History==
2016
*The Sparky [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/5/2016, in the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]].
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], changed her description. It used to read "''Sparky has a heavy-handed approach in life: Obliterate everything in sight.''"
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], changed her description. It used to read "''With coils of iron and wheels of wood, the Sparky unloads massive damage to opponents. Overkill isn't in her dictionary.''"
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November 2016 Update (1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]], changed her description slightly. It used to read "''Sparky slowly charges up, then unloads MASSIVE area damage. Overkill isn't in her dictionary''".
2017
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], decreased the Sparky's damage by 15% and decreased her attack time interval to 4 seconds (from 5 seconds).
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], fixed a bug where Sparky's hit would reset if she was knocked out of range while charging.
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Sparky from Builder's Workshop to Electro Valley.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
*On 5/12/2018, the [[Version History#December 2018 Update (5/12/2018)|December 2018 Update]], increased the Sparky's range to 5 tiles (from 4.5 tiles). This change was not mentioned in any change notes and was later said to be unintentional by Supercell, and as such it got reverted in 7/12/2018, in a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (7/12/2018)|maintenance break]].
2019
*On 7/1/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2019)|Balance Update]], reverted the Sparky to her state on 5/12/2018. More specifically, the Sparky's range was increased to 5 tiles (from 4.5 tiles).
2020
*On 7/1/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2020)|Balance Update]], removed the Sparky from all [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Draft]] selections. However, she remained in Triple Draft.
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Sparky's first attack time interval to 1 second (from 0.5 seconds).
2021 
*On 2/9/2021, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Sparky's card info screen.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], fixed a bug where Sparky was not reset when hit by [[Electro Spirit]] at the same time she was being hooked by [[Fisherman]].
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14). It also fixed an issue with Sparky's charge sound effects.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Sparky's hitpoints by 0.06%.

